Patch for verl f98fed11a7dad95ce84aaa4607ba99c5f780dd6b (https://github.com/verl-project/verl).

The router agent loop (rl/router_agent_loop.py) returns one training sample per routing step,
so the rollout batch has an arbitrary size. This patch
  - uses the per-step rollout batch directly when its size differs from the prompt batch,
  - pads batches to a multiple of the data-parallel size for log-prob/value inference and
    for actor/critic updates (padded samples have no loss),
  - skips padding-only micro-batches in the actor update, and
  - reduces metric lists that differ in length across ranks.

